{"id": "f127043e-ae7e-4870-8137-b07fb68ade7e", "slug": "system-focus-override-remix", "title": "System Focus Override - Remix", "description": "System Focus Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"System Focus Override - Remix\"\ndescription: \"System Focus Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF0B0B\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FF0B0B\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"2px\"\n  control: \"2px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# System Focus Override - Remix\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 28; favorites: 5; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, charts, flow, action.\n## Overview\nSystem Focus Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nSystem Focus Override Link Hub Status Active Polling 240 Hz - 100 Shift Adjust Calibration Controls Target Lock Gyro Sync Iris Gap f/1.4 Focus Range 0.85m Orientation 184.2° Uplink Pwr 99.8%\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: System; Focus; Override.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF0B0B, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF0B0B, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>System Focus Override - Remix</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script type=\"importmap\">\n        {\n            \"imports\": {\n                \"three\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\"\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#000000] text-white antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#FF0B0B]/30 w-screen min-h-screen flex flex-col relative pb-[44.8px] md:pb-0\">\n\n    <!-- Deep Black Base & 24px Spatial Grid -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 bg-[#000000]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #ffffff 0, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Stepped Columns Canvas -->\n    <div id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen opacity-60\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-[22.4px] py-[96px] min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Masked Reveal Title -->\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden flex gap-[16.8px] mb-[33.6px]\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 font-light\">\n                <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full opacity-0\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);\">System</span>\n            </h1>\n            <h1 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#FF0B0B] font-light\">\n                <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full opacity-0\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);\">Focus</span>\n            </h1>\n            <h1 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 font-light\">\n                <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full opacity-0\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);\">Override</span>\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col gap-[22.4px]\">\n\n            <!-- Top Stacked Row -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row w-full gap-[22.4px] items-stretch justify-center\">\n\n                <!-- Left Status Module -->\n                <div class=\"w-full md:w-56 flex flex-col relative border-x border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-[12px]\" style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) 1;\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-[22.4px] flex flex-col gap-[33.6px] relative h-full justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md p-[11.2px] border-b border-white/10 rounded-[2px] mb-[5.6px]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/70 font-light\">Link</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[5.6px]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500 font-light\">Hub Status</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm text-[#FF0B0B] font-light uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-[11.2px]\">\n                                <span class=\"w-[5.6px] h-[5.6px] rounded-none bg-[#FF0B0B] animate-[pulse_2s_ease-in-out_infinite]\"></span> Active\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[5.6px]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500 font-light\">Polling</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl text-white font-light tracking-[-0.05em] tabular-nums\">240 Hz</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Center Interactive Lens Module -->\n                <div class=\"w-full flex-1 max-w-2xl relative border-x border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-[12px]\" style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) 1;\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"py-[44.8px] px-[16.8px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative min-h-[403.2px]\">\n                        <!-- Interactive Lens Component -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[320px] aspect-square flex flex-col items-center justify-center group cursor-ew-resize\" id=\"dial-container\">\n\n                            <!-- WebGL Canvas Layer -->\n                            <div id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- UI Overlay Layer -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-10\">\n                                <!-- Center Pointer -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-[22.4px]\">\n                                    <svg width=\"10\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 7\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"drop-shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(255,11,11,0.5)] rotate-180\">\n                                        <path d=\"M5 7L0 0H10L5 7Z\" fill=\"#FF0B0B\"/>\n                                    </svg>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Value Display -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-[5.6px] -mt-[11.2px]\">\n                                    <span id=\"value-sign\" class=\"text-3xl font-light text-[#FF0B0B]/80\">-</span>\n                                    <span id=\"value-number\" class=\"text-6xl tracking-[-0.05em] font-light text-[#FF0B0B] tabular-nums\">100</span>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Bottom Controls -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-[33.6px] w-full flex justify-center items-center gap-[22.4px] pointer-events-none\">\n                                    <button class=\"text-[#FF0B0B]/50 hover:text-[#FF0B0B] border border-transparent hover:border-[#FF0B0B]/30 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-auto p-[5.6px] rounded-[2px] bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:minus-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </button>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-slate-400 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">Shift</span>\n                                    <button class=\"text-[#FF0B0B]/50 hover:text-[#FF0B0B] border border-transparent hover:border-[#FF0B0B]/30 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-auto p-[5.6px] rounded-[2px] bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Drag Hint -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[44.8px] text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none\">\n                                Adjust Calibration\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Action Module -->\n                <div class=\"w-full md:w-56 flex flex-col relative border-x border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-[12px]\" style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) 1;\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-[22.4px] flex flex-col gap-[22.4px] relative h-full justify-end\">\n\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md p-[11.2px] border-b border-white/10 rounded-[2px] mb-auto mt-[5.6px]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/70 font-light\">Controls</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Technical Control Buttons -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11.2px]\">\n                            <button class=\"w-full rounded-[2px] bg-white hover:bg-gray-200 text-black p-[16.8px] flex items-center justify-between transition-colors group border-none\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-medium transition-colors\">Target Lock</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:focus-target-linear\" class=\"text-black\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"w-full rounded-[2px] border border-[#FF0B0B]/30 bg-[#FF0B0B]/5 hover:bg-[#FF0B0B]/10 p-[16.8px] flex items-center justify-between transition-colors group backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#FF0B0B] font-light transition-colors\">Gyro Sync</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:camera-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-[#FF0B0B] transition-colors\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Grid Analytics Module -->\n            <div class=\"w-full relative border-x border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-[12px]\" style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) 1;\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-10\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 divide-x divide-y md:divide-y-0 divide-white/10 relative\">\n                    <!-- Strict Proportional Metrics -->\n                    <div class=\"p-[22.4px] flex flex-col gap-[11.2px]\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500 font-light\">Iris Gap</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-lg text-[#FF0B0B] font-light tracking-[-0.05em] tabular-nums\">f/1.4</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-[22.4px] flex flex-col gap-[11.2px]\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500 font-light\">Focus Range</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-lg text-white font-light tracking-[-0.05em] tabular-nums\">0.85m</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-[22.4px] flex flex-col gap-[11.2px]\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500 font-light\">Orientation</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-lg text-white font-light tracking-[-0.05em] tabular-nums\">184.2°</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-[22.4px] flex flex-col gap-[11.2px]\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500 font-light\">Uplink Pwr</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-lg text-white font-light tracking-[-0.05em] tabular-nums\">99.8%</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- WebGL & Interaction Logic -->\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import * as THREE from 'three';\n\n        // GSAP Masked Reveal Animation\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n        gsap.to('.gsap-reveal', {\n            y: '0%',\n            opacity: 1,\n            stagger: 0.15,\n            duration: 1.2,\n            ease: 'power4.out',\n            delay: 0.2\n        });\n\n        // --- Background Vertical Stepped Columns WebGL ---\n        const bgCanvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const bgScene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const bgCamera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0.1, 10);\n        bgCamera.position.z = 1;\n\n        const bgRenderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: false });\n        bgRenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        bgCanvas.appendChild(bgRenderer.domElement);\n\n        const bgGeometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n        const bgMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n            uniforms: { u_time: { value: 0.0 } },\n            vertexShader: `\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n                void main() {\n                    vUv = uv;\n                    gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                }\n            `,\n            fragmentShader: `\n                uniform float u_time;\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n\n                float random(vec2 st) {\n                    return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 uv = vUv;\n                    // Vertical stepped columns\n                    float cols = 40.0;\n                    float colIndex = floor(uv.x * cols);\n                    float noiseBase = random(vec2(colIndex, 0.0));\n\n                    // Vertical movement & stepping\n                    float steps = 20.0;\n                    float yStep = floor((uv.y + u_time * 0.04 * noiseBase) * steps) / steps;\n\n                    // Intensity driven by column & step\n                    float intensity = random(vec2(colIndex, yStep)) * 0.12;\n\n                    // Grain perturbed edges\n                    float grain = (random(uv + u_time) - 0.5) * 0.08;\n\n                    vec3 color = vec3(0.02) + vec3(intensity) + grain;\n\n                    // Dithered mapping\n                    color = floor(color * 12.0) / 12.0;\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n                }\n            `,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 1.0\n        });\n\n        const bgMesh = new THREE.Mesh(bgGeometry, bgMaterial);\n        bgScene.add(bgMesh);\n\n        // --- Foreground Dial WebGL Setup ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n        const dialContainer = document.getElementById('dial-container');\n        const valueSign = document.getElementById('value-sign');\n        const valueNumber = document.getElementById('value-number');\n\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0.1, 10);\n        camera.position.z = 1;\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // Custom Shader Interface\n        const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n        const vertexShader = `\n            varying vec2 vUv;\n            void main() {\n                vUv = uv;\n                gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n            }\n        `;\n\n        const fragmentShader = `\n            uniform float u_progress;\n            uniform float u_time;\n            varying vec2 vUv;\n\n            #define PI 3.14159265359\n\n            void main() {\n                vec2 center = vec2(0.5);\n                vec2 pos = vUv - center;\n\n                float r = length(pos) * 2.0;\n                if (r > 1.0) discard;\n\n                float angle = atan(pos.x, pos.y);\n                vec3 color = vec3(0.0);\n\n                // Outer subtle casing rim\n                float casing = smoothstep(0.99, 0.97, r) * smoothstep(0.94, 0.96, r);\n                color += vec3(0.04) * casing;\n\n                // Tick Marks\n                if (r > 0.82 && r < 0.92) {\n                    float numTicks = 120.0;\n                    float tickPattern = fract((angle / (2.0 * PI)) * numTicks);\n                    float tickLine = smoothstep(0.15, 0.05, abs(tickPattern - 0.5));\n\n                    float isMajor = step(0.9, fract((angle / (2.0 * PI)) * (numTicks / 10.0) + 0.5));\n                    float tickInner = mix(0.88, 0.82, isMajor);\n\n                    if (r > tickInner) {\n                        float alpha = smoothstep(0.8, 0.1, cos(angle) * -1.0);\n                        color += vec3(0.3) * tickLine * alpha;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Glowing Track Arc (High-chroma #FF0B0B)\n                float trackR = 0.74;\n                float trackDist = abs(r - trackR);\n                float trackBase = smoothstep(0.012, 0.004, trackDist);\n\n                float targetAngle = u_progress * PI;\n\n                float isActive = 0.0;\n                if (targetAngle > 0.0 && angle > 0.0 && angle <= targetAngle) isActive = 1.0;\n                if (targetAngle < 0.0 && angle < 0.0 && angle >= targetAngle) isActive = 1.0;\n\n                vec3 primaryColor = vec3(1.0, 0.043, 0.043); // #FF0B0B\n                vec3 darkTrackColor = vec3(0.08);\n\n                vec3 currentTrackColor = mix(darkTrackColor, primaryColor, isActive);\n                color += currentTrackColor * trackBase;\n\n                // Radial Glow\n                if (isActive > 0.0) {\n                    float glow = exp(-trackDist * 45.0) * 0.6;\n                    color += primaryColor * glow;\n                }\n\n                // Inner Lens Details\n                float ring1 = smoothstep(0.008, 0.00, abs(r - 0.58));\n                float ring2 = smoothstep(0.008, 0.00, abs(r - 0.42));\n                color += vec3(0.05) * (ring1 + ring2);\n\n                if (r < 0.58) {\n                    float reflection = smoothstep(0.58, 0.0, length(pos + vec2(0.1, -0.1))) * 0.06;\n                    color += vec3(0.3, 0.1, 0.1) * reflection;\n                }\n\n                float centerDark = smoothstep(0.0, 0.6, r);\n                color *= mix(vec3(0.7), vec3(1.0), centerDark);\n\n                gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n            }\n        `;\n\n        const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n            vertexShader,\n            fragmentShader,\n            uniforms: {\n                u_progress: { value: 0.0 },\n                u_time: { value: 0.0 }\n            },\n            transparent: true\n        });\n\n        const plane = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n        scene.add(plane);\n\n        // --- Interaction Logic ---\n        let currentValue = -100;\n        let targetValue = -100;\n        let isDragging = false;\n        let startX = 0;\n\n        function updateDOM() {\n            const rounded = Math.round(currentValue);\n            valueSign.innerText = rounded < 0 ? '-' : (rounded > 0 ? '+' : '');\n            valueNumber.innerText = Math.abs(rounded);\n\n            const mappedProgress = (currentValue / 100) * 0.85;\n            material.uniforms.u_progress.value = mappedProgress;\n        }\n\n        updateDOM();\n\n        dialContainer.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {\n            isDragging = true;\n            startX = e.clientX;\n            document.body.style.cursor = 'ew-resize';\n        });\n\n        window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            if (!isDragging) return;\n            const deltaX = e.clientX - startX;\n            targetValue += deltaX * 0.35;\n            targetValue = Math.max(-100, Math.min(100, targetValue));\n            startX = e.clientX;\n        });\n\n        window.addEventListener('mouseup', () => {\n            isDragging = false;\n            document.body.style.cursor = '';\n        });\n\n        dialContainer.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {\n            isDragging = true;\n            startX = e.touches[0].clientX;\n        }, {passive: true});\n\n        window.addEventListener('touchmove', (e) => {\n            if (!isDragging) return;\n            const deltaX = e.touches[0].clientX - startX;\n            targetValue += deltaX * 0.35;\n            targetValue = Math.max(-100, Math.min(100, targetValue));\n            startX = e.touches[0].clientX;\n        }, {passive: true});\n\n        window.addEventListener('touchend', () => isDragging = false);\n\n        // --- Render Loop & Resizing ---\n        function resize() {\n            // Foreground dial resize\n            const width = container.clientWidth;\n            const height = container.clientHeight;\n            renderer.setSize(width, height);\n\n            // Background canvas resize\n            bgRenderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            // Dial animation\n            currentValue += (targetValue - currentValue) * 0.15;\n            if(Math.abs(targetValue - currentValue) > 0.01) {\n                 updateDOM();\n            }\n            material.uniforms.u_time.value = clock.getElapsedTime();\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n\n            // Background columns animation\n            bgMaterial.uniforms.u_time.value = clock.getElapsedTime();\n            bgRenderer.render(bgScene, bgCamera);\n        }\n        animate();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "system-focus-override-remix.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/system-focus-override-remix.jpg", "source_name": "system-focus-override-remix-DESIGN.md", "views": 88, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T02:53:50.430119+00:00"}